  "body": "As an admin I want that all content of a room is deleted when a room is removed for that there is no orphaned events/messages/media and I can keep storage under control as well as comply with legal requirements.\n\n* Deleting a room should delete all of its contents \\(events/media\\)\n* This should work for local rooms as well as remote rooms that comply with the spec",
